SCH-FD-08 termination discards a pending repetition, and the scheduler then rejects new ones -> next=marker from deadLetters | pending: isCancelled=false cancel=true isCancelled=true cancel=false isCancelled=true | initial zero => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown] | initial 1s => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown] | initial too far => ERR IllegalStateException [cannot enqueue after timer shutdown] | delay zero => ERR IllegalArgumentException [Task scheduled with [0] seconds delay, which means creating an infinite loop. The expected delay must be greater than 0.]
